Description: fast link checker for Markdown, HTML and websites
 lychee checks links in Markdown, HTML, reStructuredText and plain
 text, concurrently and with caching, and reports broken ones with
 status codes. Built for CI use: globs, excludes, retries and a
 configurable failure threshold.
